This adds a simple helper to `Http` which allows you do build your overall apps out of sub-apps such as;

```scala
Http.route[Request] {
    case _ -> Root / "graphql" =>
        ZHTTPAdapter.makeHttpService(api)
    case _ -> Root / "ws" =>
        ZHTTPAdapter.makeWebSocketService(api)
}
```

in the cases where the sub application needs to specify multiple handlers (such as handling multiple HTTP methods easily).

